  [""]
  <br>Someone also tipped [namer] [tips]! ^[(tipBox.checked)*20000]
  <br>The total of tips [namer] made was [tips]! ^[(r1 == "report8") ? 1 : 0]
  <br>Someone also tipped [namer] [tips]! ^[String(Joblist.selectOne).includes("Waiter") ? 200000 : 0] 
  <br>Someone also tipped [namer] [tips]! ^[String(Joblist.selectOne).includes("Bounty") ? 200000 : 0] 
